      "en": "Therefore I praised the dead who have been long dead more than the living who are yet alive.",
      "ko": "그러므로 나는 살아 있는 산 자보다 죽은지 오랜 죽은 자를 복되다 하였으며",
      "source_text_hash": "8f94b25b3ca4c841c40dbbc21ac403475e284a815b9e6e1309023f4788921128",
      "translation_text_hash": "bfc3d101d6f291e0926a0aa210f139102a472bba8b9cdebfc6189ec634ad87b6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
