      "en": "The fool folds his hands together and ruins himself.",
      "ko": "우매자는 손을 거두고 자기 살을 먹느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "dd1ab4e87e445d92f3eb34a4cb9e4af8a992a1a66a6526bd16de0d885ca32e79",
      "translation_text_hash": "95525a798b32e3753319335f46dcd76fdd88ac56cc9a3ebbb09be500db52a049",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "우매자는 손을 거두고 자기 살을 먹느니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "95525a798b32e3753319335f46dcd76fdd88ac56cc9a3ebbb09be500db52a049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ECC:4:6",
      "sequence": 17388,
      "chapter_label": "ECC 4",
      "verse_label": "6",
      "locator": {
        "book": "ECC",
