        "verse": 11
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ECC",
          "chapter": 4,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "Again, if two lie together, then they have warmth; but how can one keep warm alone?",
      "ko": "두 사람이 함께 누우면 따뜻하거니와 한 사람이면 어찌 따뜻하랴",
      "source_text_hash": "27dd820c46562aa872ab805f461ce0a49a9e5b29b66f7bcfbbb7d3d052c5c146",
      "translation_text_hash": "55f85d6fb08cf442840c958de7834a3cf5ac9c9b8c4ee114f2ef6aeac9641ef4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "두 사람이 함께 누우면 따뜻하거니와 한 사람이면 어찌 따뜻하랴"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "55f85d6fb08cf442840c958de7834a3cf5ac9c9b8c4ee114f2ef6aeac9641ef4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ECC:4:12",
      "sequence": 17394,
      "chapter_label": "ECC 4",
      "verse_label": "12",
      "locator": {
